    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        CRM-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span>-Bench: Benchmarking Tool-Using <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> in Stateful Enterprise Environments
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Banerjee%2C+M">Monojit Banerjee</a>, 
      
