      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12988">arXiv:2610.12988</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.12988">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2610.12988">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2610.12988">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
