        Tracking State Footprints: How <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> Can <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transact</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mraz%2C+O">Oto Mraz</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=%C5%9Eerban%2C+R">Rares Şerban</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Psarakis%2C+K">Kyriakos Psarakis</a>, 
      
