    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Proof-Gated Signing: Solver-Checked <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transaction</span> Guards that Hold Under State Drift for Onchain AI <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ghosh%2C+B">Bravish Ghosh</a>
      
