    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        A Building as a Repository: KIR, a Typed Intermediate Representation for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span>-Authored Building Information Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kuklev%2C+D">Dmitry Kuklev</a>
      
