    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        ChainClaw: A Layered <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Framework for Reliable On-Chain <span class="search-hit mathjax">Execution</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wei%2C+J">Jiacheng Wei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fan%2C+Z">Zhaoxin Fan</a>, 
      
